    "body": "Not supporting data: is OK for me given https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/issues/161#issuecomment-156414633 and we still support blobs.\n\nI'd like to retain a note saying that data: doesn't work, that cross-origin URLs don't work, and that blob URLs do work, so that people reading this part of the spec know what to expect without having to read through the Fetch spec also.\n",
